description = Three kinds of logic puzzle, made fresh every time, each with exactly one answer: Sudoku; Picture Grid (nonograms: fill the cells the numbers describe to find a picture); and Cages (each number once per row and column, with cages that add, take away, multiply or divide to their targets). Easy, Medium and Hard, and a Daily puzzle of each kind that is the same for everyone. Notes, undo, and hints that explain the next step or point out a wrong entry. Your puzzle in progress and best times are kept with your account. Plays with a mouse, the keyboard, a controller or touch. Made for Rudolf OS.
